  "outstanding": [
    "The density step identifying joint invariants with constants and the existence of suitable primes at the global field are separate suppliers. Finiteness of the triple indices uses a finite separating map via reduction of integral conjugates modulo π². Those supporting arguments are cited at their written interfaces; the exact spectrum is computed only for the illustrated residue graph."
  ],
  "review_scope": "The flag types and their ordered stabilizers, two finite-index bounds, normalized correlation inequality and q=25 computation were independently checked against the pinned supplier. The projection gap in FIN-04 was checked against ClosureBound, including the passage from the range to the orthogonal complement of the kernel. The downstream Hecke comparison is in HMT-03."
}
